{"modified":"2026-10-21T09:05:02","content":{"raw":"<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Section\"},\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"is-style-ext-preset\\u002d\\u002dgroup\\u002d\\u002dnatural-1\\u002d\\u002dsection ext-animate\\u002d\\u002don\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"background\",\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--section ext-animate--on has-background-background-color has-background\" id=\"contact\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"medlux-contact-top ext-animate\\u002d\\u002don\",\"backgroundColor\":\"tertiary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide are-vertically-aligned-top medlux-contact-top ext-animate--on has-tertiary-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\",\"width\":\"46%\",\"className\":\"medlux-contact-side\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top medlux-contact-side\" style=\"flex-basis:46%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":2048,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-team-photo\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full medlux-team-photo\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-team-2026b.jpg\" alt=\"The MedLuxLife team at their office desk\" class=\"wp-image-2048\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">[trp_language language=\"en_GB\"]Get in touch with MedLuxLife \u2014 we arrange medical consultations with our partner clinics and carefully planned travel with trusted international partners.[\/trp_language][trp_language language=\"de_DE\"]Nehmen Sie Kontakt mit MedLuxLife auf \u2013 wir vermitteln medizinische Konsultationen bei unseren Partnerkliniken und organisieren sorgf\u00e4ltig geplante Reisen mit vertrauensw\u00fcrdigen internationalen Partnern.[\/trp_language][trp_language language=\"tr_TR\"]MedLuxLife ile ileti\u015fime ge\u00e7in \u2014 partner kliniklerimizde t\u0131bbi g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmeler ayarl\u0131yor, g\u00fcvenilir uluslararas\u0131 partnerlerimizle \u00f6zenle planlanm\u0131\u015f seyahatler organize ediyoruz.[\/trp_language]<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"8px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"12px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Icon\"},\"className\":\"\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"duotone\":\"var:preset|duotone|foreground-and-background\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"tel:+4916093448714\">+49 160 93 44 87 14<\/a><\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"12px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Icon\"},\"className\":\"\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"duotone\":\"var:preset|duotone|foreground-and-background\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">+380 97 909 23 26 (WhatsApp)<\/a><\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"12px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Icon\"},\"className\":\"\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"duotone\":\"var:preset|duotone|foreground-and-background\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"mailto:info@medluxlife.de\">info@medluxlife.de<\/a><\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-languages-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-languages-note\">[trp_language language=\"en_GB\"]We speak Turkish, Ukrainian, Russian, English and German.[\/trp_language][trp_language language=\"de_DE\"]Wir sprechen T\u00fcrkisch, Ukrainisch, Russisch, Englisch und Deutsch.[\/trp_language][trp_language language=\"tr_TR\"]T\u00fcrk\u00e7e, Ukraynaca, Rus\u00e7a, \u0130ngilizce ve Almanca konu\u015fuyoruz.[\/trp_language]<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-whatsapp-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-whatsapp-note\">WhatsApp is for general questions and organisation. Please do not send medical documents there \u2013 if documents are needed, the doctor will ask for them after your consultation.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\",\"width\":\"54%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\" style=\"flex-basis:54%\"><!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Contact Form\",\"categories\":[\"section\"]},\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"ext-animate\\u002d\\u002don\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide ext-animate--on\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[contact-form-7 id=\"589\" title=\"MedLuxLife Contact\" html_class=\"medlux-form\"]\n<!-- \/wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<script id=\"medlux-health-consent-js\">\n(function () {\n  function setup(form) {\n    var sel = form.querySelector('select[name=\"your-subject\"]');\n    var box = form.querySelector('.medlux-health-consent');\n    if (!sel || !box) return;\n    var checks = box.querySelectorAll('input[type=\"checkbox\"]');\n    var msg = document.createElement('p');\n    msg.className = 'medlux-consent-error';\n    msg.setAttribute('role', 'alert');\n    box.appendChild(msg);\n    function sync() {\n      var health = sel.value === 'Health';\n      box.classList.toggle('is-visible', health);\n      if (!health) { checks.forEach(function (c) { c.checked = false; }); msg.textContent = ''; }\n    }\n    sel.addEventListener('change', sync);\n    checks.forEach(function (c) { c.addEventListener('change', function () { msg.textContent = ''; }); });\n    document.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n      if (e.target !== form || sel.value !== 'Health') return;\n      var ok = Array.prototype.every.call(checks, function (c) { return c.checked; });\n      if (!ok) {\n        e.preventDefault(); e.stopImmediatePropagation();\n        var L = (document.documentElement.lang || 'en').slice(0, 2); var M = { en: 'Please confirm both consents to send a health enquiry.', de: 'Bitte best\u00e4tigen Sie beide Einwilligungen, um eine Gesundheitsanfrage zu senden.', tr: 'Sa\u011fl\u0131kla ilgili bir talep g\u00f6ndermek i\u00e7in l\u00fctfen her iki onay\u0131 da verin.', uk: '\u0429\u043e\u0431 \u043d\u0430\u0434\u0456\u0441\u043b\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0442 \u0449\u043e\u0434\u043e \u0437\u0434\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0432\u2019\u044f, \u043f\u0456\u0434\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0434\u044c\u0442\u0435, \u0431\u0443\u0434\u044c \u043b\u0430\u0441\u043a\u0430, \u043e\u0431\u0438\u0434\u0432\u0456 \u0437\u0433\u043e\u0434\u0438.', ru: '\u0427\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043e\u0442\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441 \u043f\u043e \u0432\u043e\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0430\u043c \u0437\u0434\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0432\u044c\u044f, \u043f\u043e\u0436\u0430\u043b\u0443\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0430, \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043e\u0431\u0430 \u0441\u043e\u0433\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0438\u044f.', ar: '\u0644\u0625\u0631\u0633\u0627\u0644 \u0627\u0633\u062a\u0641\u0633\u0627\u0631 \u064a\u062a\u0639\u0644\u0642 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0635\u062d\u0629\u060c \u064a\u064f\u0631\u062c\u0649 \u062a\u0623\u0643\u064a\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0641\u0642\u062a\u064a\u0646.' }; msg.textContent = M[L] || M.en;\n        box.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });\n      }\n    }, true);\n    form.addEventListener('wpcf7mailsent', function () { setTimeout(sync, 0); });\n    sync();\n  }\n  function init() { document.querySelectorAll('form.wpcf7-form').forEach(setup); }\n  if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init); else init();\n})();\n<\/script>\n<!-- \/wp:html --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Section\"},\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"is-style-ext-preset\\u002d\\u002dgroup\\u002d\\u002dnatural-1\\u002d\\u002dsection ext-section\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|55\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"background\",\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--section ext-section has-background-background-color has-background\" id=\"faq\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Section Intro\"},\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"ext-section-intro is-style-ext-preset\\u002d\\u002dgroup\\u002d\\u002dnatural-1\\u002d\\u002dsection-intro-1\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide ext-section-intro is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--section-intro-1 has-custom-css\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Frequently Asked Questions<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ext-animate\\u002d\\u002don\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}},\"textColor\":\"foreground-alt\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"ext-animate--on has-foreground-alt-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Answers to the most common questions about our health and travel services.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ext-animate\\u002d\\u002don\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ext-animate--on\"><!-- wp:accordion {\"className\":\"medlux-faq\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion medlux-faq\"><!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How does the free consultation work?<\/span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button><\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send us your enquiry via the contact form, by email or on WhatsApp. We will get back to you, talk through your wishes and explain the next steps. The first consultation is free of charge and non-binding.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-panel --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Does MedLuxLife carry out medical treatments itself?<\/span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button><\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No. MedLuxLife informs, organises and coordinates. Treatments are carried out by qualified doctors at our partner hospital and partner clinics, and the treatment contract is concluded directly with them. Whether a treatment is suitable for you is decided by the treating doctor.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-panel --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Where do the treatments take place?<\/span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button><\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At our partner hospital and partner clinics in T\u00fcrkiye. We coordinate your appointments, accommodation and transfers so that you can concentrate on your treatment.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-panel --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Should I send medical documents with my first enquiry?<\/span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button><\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please do not send detailed medical information or documents via the contact form or WhatsApp. If documents are needed, the doctor will ask for them in your online consultation and you share them directly with the doctor.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-panel --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How much does a treatment cost?<\/span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button><\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment is planned individually, so we do not publish prices on our website. After the consultation you receive a personal written offer.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-panel --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-item --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ext-animate\\u002d\\u002don\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ext-animate--on\"><!-- wp:accordion {\"className\":\"medlux-faq\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion medlux-faq\"><!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I book travel services without a treatment?<\/span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button><\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes. Our travel services \u2013 holiday packages, hotel reservations, flight tickets, airport transfers and Hajj &amp; Umrah \u2013 are independent of our health services and can be booked on their own.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-panel --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Do you arrange Hajj and Umrah trips?<\/span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button><\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes. We arrange Hajj and Umrah trips together with licensed tour operators and inform you about the passport, visa and vaccination requirements.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-panel --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Which languages do you speak?<\/span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button><\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are happy to assist you in German, English, Turkish, Ukrainian and Russian.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-panel --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Where is MedLuxLife based?<\/span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button><\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>MedLuxLife is based in Aachen, Germany.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-panel --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How can I cancel a booking?<\/span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button><\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please send your cancellation to info@medluxlife.de. Details can be found in our <a href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/stornierungsbedingungen\/\">cancellation policy<\/a> and our <a href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/widerrufsbelehrung\/\">withdrawal information<\/a>.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-panel --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion-item --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:accordion --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->"}}